Algorithm: Shadow Profile
Input: S ⊆ ℕⁿ (support set, all elements of degree d), degree d
Output: (σ₀, σ₁, ..., σ_d) shadow cardinality sequence

for k = 0 to d:
    Shadow_k ← ∅
    for each α ∈ S:
        for each β with |β| = d-k and β_i ≤ α_i for all i:
            Shadow_k ← Shadow_k ∪ {β}
    σ_k ← |Shadow_k|
return (σ₀, ..., σ_d)

Complexity: O(d · |S| · max_k |Sh_k|)
Space: O(max_k |Sh_k|)
